            "page": 76,
            "publicationId": "30f0-6ecb-d1bf-eb3e"
          },
          {
            "name": "War Dance",
            "id": "4eac-326f-d5cd-a5ce",
            "description": "Once per cycle, before this unit or the enemy unit attacks, decide which war dance this unit will perform until the end of the cycle.\n\n\n- “Whirlwind of Death” –  The unit gets +1 to S.\n- “Whirlwind of Ecstasy” –  Each Wound inflicted upon this unit may be cancelled by a whirlwind of blades and shields. Roll a D6 for each inflicted Wound. Each score of 2 or less means a cancelled Wound.",
